<Base title="About" description="Rikard Ekstam. Curious by nature, builder at heart. Technology, design, product and a place to connect."><div class="page-wrap interior"><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE PROJECTS</p><h1>HI, I’M<br /><span>RIKARD.</span></h1><p class="lead">Curious by nature. Builder at heart.</p></header><div class="about-grid"><div class="prose"><h2>Ideas are a starting point.</h2><p>I’m interested in the space where technology, design and making things meet. Some ideas become projects. Others stay experiments. There’s something to learn from both.</p><p>This site is my own little corner of the internet: a place for the things I build and the discoveries I want to keep along the way.</p><blockquote>Explore. Execute. Evolve.</blockquote><p>It’s a work in progress. That’s part of the point.</p></div><div class="about-photo"><img src="/images/workspace.jpg" alt="Plants and a laptop in a bright workspace" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" /><span>SPACE TO THINK. ROOM TO BUILD.</span></div></div><section id="contact" class="contact-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">GOOD THINGS START WITH A CONVERSATION</p><h2>Let’s connect.</h2><p>Have a shared interest or something you’re building?<br />You can find me on GitHub.</p></div><a class="button primary" href={site.github}>Find me on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section></div></Base>
